<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ကျန်းမာစွာ အသားတက်ရန် ကယ်လိုရီနှင့် အစားအသောက် ဇယား (AI Powered)</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
        }
    </script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pyidaungsu:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Pyidaungsu', sans-serif;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
        }
        .dark .glass-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.4);
        }
        button, input, select, label {
            pointer-events: auto !important;
            cursor: pointer !important;
        }
        @keyframes floatSlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(2deg); }
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: floatSlow 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulseGlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.12); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pulse-glow {
            animation: pulseGlow 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shine {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%) rotate(45deg); }
            100% { transform: translateX(200%) rotate(45deg); }
        }
        .logo-shine {
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            animation: shine 3s infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body id="appBody" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-teal-50 to-cyan-100 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col transition-colors duration-500">

    <!-- Auth / Login Gateway Screen (Mandatory before entering app) -->
    <div id="authGatewayScreen" class="fixed inset-0 z-[9999] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950 via-teal-950 to-slate-950 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 text-white text-center">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-md w-full rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl relative border border-slate-700/50 bg-white/10 dark:bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative mb-5">
                <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/40 via-teal-500/40 to-cyan-500/40 rounded-full blur-2xl animate-pulse-glow"></div>
                <div class="relative w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-600 via-teal-500 to-cyan-400 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-white/40 mx-auto animate-float overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="logo-shine"></div>
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-12 w-12 text-white drop-shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <span class="bg-white/20 text-emerald-200 text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/30 mb-2.5 inline-block shadow-sm">✨ Next-Gen AI Health & Fitness</span>
            <h1 id="gatewayTitle" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-1 text-white">Muscle & Calorie Pro</h1>
            <p id="gatewaySub" class="text-emerald-100 text-xs max-w-sm mx-auto font-medium mb-6 leading-relaxed">ကျန်းမာစွာ အသားတက်ရန် အသုံးမပြုမီ ကျေးဇူးပြု၍ အကောင့်ဝင်ပါ (Login required)</p>
            
            <!-- Quick Social / Phone Auth buttons -->
            <div class="space-y-2.5 mb-5">
                <button type="button" onclick="instantLogin('Google')" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition transform active:scale-98">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M23.745 12.27c0-.7-.06-1.4-.19-2.07H12v4.51h6.6c-.29 1.52-1.14 2.82-2.4 3.68v3.05h3.88c2.27-2.09 3.66-5.17 3.66-9.17z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 24c3.24 0 5.95-1.08 7.93-2.91l-3.88-3.05c-1.08.72-2.45 1.16-4.05 1.16-3.12 0-5.77-2.1-6.72-4.93H1.19v3.15C3.17 21.36 7.24 24 12 24z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.28 14.27c-.25-.72-.38-1.49-.38-2.27s.13-1.55.38-2.27V6.58H1.19C.43 8.1 0 9.8 0 12s.43 3.9 1.19 5.42l4.09-3.15z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 4.75c1.77 0 3.35.61 4.6 1.8l3.42-3.42C17.95 1.19 15.24 0 12 0 7.24 0 3.17 2.64 1.19 6.58l4.09 3.15c.95-2.83 3.6-4.98 6.72-4.98z"/></svg>
                    <span>Google ဖြင့် ချက်ချင်းဝင်မည်</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" onclick="instantLogin('Facebook')" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#1877F2] hover:bg-[#166fe5] text-white py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition transform active:scale-98">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
                    <span>Facebook ဖြင့် ချက်ချင်းဝင်မည်</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" onclick="instantLogin('Phone')" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition transform active:scale-98">
                    <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/></svg>
                    <span>ဖုန်းနံပါတ်ဖြင့် ချက်ချင်းဝင်မည်</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="relative flex py-2 items-center">
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-white/20"></div>
                <span class="flex-shrink mx-3 text-xs text-slate-300 uppercase font-semibold">သို့မဟုတ် အီးမေးလ်ဖြင့်</span>
                <div class="flex-grow border-t border-white/20"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 mt-3">
                <input type="text" id="gatewayEmail" placeholder="example@gmail.com" class="w-full border border-white/20 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-inner">
                <input type="password" id="gatewayPass" placeholder="စကားဝှက် (Password)" class="w-full border border-white/20 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-xs bg-slate-800/80 text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-inner">
                
                <button type="button" onclick="handleGatewayLogin()" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-teal-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition text-xs transform active:scale-98">
                    ✨ အကောင့်ဝင်ပြီး အက်ပ်ကိုစတင်မည် (Login)
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 via-teal-600 to-cyan-700 dark:from-emerald-950 dark:via-teal-950 dark:to-slate-900 text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-15 bg-[radial-gradient(#fff_1.5px,transparent_1.5px)] [background-size:20px_20px] pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 relative z-20">
            <div class="text-center sm:text-left flex items-center gap-4">
                <div class="relative w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500 via-teal-400 to-cyan-300 rounded-3xl border-2 border-white/40 flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl shrink-0 animate-float overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="logo-shine"></div>
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-9 w-9 text-white drop-shadow-md" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-white/20 text-emerald-100 dark:text-emerald-300 text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/30 inline-block mb-1.5 shadow-sm" id="headerBadge">✨ Created by MR.SAI SWEET HURM</span>
                    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white" id="mainTitle">💪 အသားပြည့်ပြည့် ဝဝဖြိုးဖြိုး ဇယား</h1>
                    <p class="text-emerald-100 dark:text-emerald-200 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1 max-w-xl font-medium" id="subTitle">Gemini AI ဖြင့် ကယ်လိုရီ၊ အစားအစာ၊ အိပ်ချိန်နှင့် ရေသောက်သုံးမှုကို တွက်ချက်ပေးသော စနစ်</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 relative z-50 flex-wrap justify-center sm:justify-end">
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleLanguage()" id="langBtn" class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 transition shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold shrink-0 hover:scale-105">
                    🌐 <span id="langText">မြန်မာ (Myanmar)</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleTheme()" id="themeBtn" class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 transition shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold shrink-0 hover:scale-105">
                    <span id="themeIcon">🌙</span> <span id="themeText">Dark</span>
                </button>
                <div id="userProfileBadge" class="hidden bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 text-white px-3.5 py-2 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">
                    👤 <span id="profileNameDisplay">အကောင့်ဝင်ပြီး</span>
                    <button type="button" onclick="logoutApp()" class="text-rose-300 hover:text-white ml-1 text-xs underline" id="logoutText">ထွက်ရန်</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex-grow w-full space-y-6 relative z-10">

        <!-- Calculator Section -->
        <section class="glass-card rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 transition duration-300 hover:shadow-emerald-500/10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 rounded-2xl shadow-inner shrink-0 border border-emerald-500/30">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white" id="calcTitle">၁။ ကယ်လိုရီ လိုအပ်ချက် တွက်ချက်ရန်</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" id="calcSub">သင်၏ ခန္ဓာကိုယ်အချက်အလက်များကို ထည့်သွင်းပါ</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider" id="labelGender">ကျား/မ</label>
                    <select id="gender" class="w-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-sm bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-sm transition">
                        <option value="male" id="optMale">ကျား (Male)</option>
                        <option value="female" id="optFemale">မ (Female)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider" id="labelAge">အသက် (နှစ်)</label>
                    <input type="number" id="age" value="25" class="w-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-sm bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider" id="labelHeight">အရပ် (စင်တီမီတာ)</label>
                    <input type="number" id="height" value="170" class="w-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-sm bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-sm transition">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider" id="labelWeight">အလေးချိန် (ကေဂျီ)</label>
                    <input type="number" id="weight" value="55" class="w-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-sm bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-sm transition">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-6">
                <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider" id="labelActivity">ကိုယ်လက်လှုပ်ရှားမှု ပမာဏ</label>
                <select id="activity" class="w-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-3.5 text-sm bg-white/90 dark:bg-slate-800/90 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 outline-none shadow-sm transition">
                    <option value="1.2" id="optAct1">ရုံးထိုင်အလုပ် သို့မဟုတ် လှုပ်ရှားမှုနည်းခြင်း (Sedentary)</option>
                    <option value="1.375" selected id="optAct2">အလယ်အလတ် လှုပ်ရှားမှု (တစ်ပတ် ၂-၃ ရက် လေ့ကျင့်ခန်း)</option>
                    <option value="1.55" id="optAct3">လှုပ်ရှားမှုများခြင်း (တစ်ပတ် ၄-၅ ရက် လေ့ကျင့်ခန်း)</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <button type="button" onclick="calculateCalories()" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 via-teal-600 to-cyan-600 hover:from-emerald-700 hover:to-cyan-700 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl transition duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-600/20 text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transform active:scale-98" id="calcBtnText">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
                ကယ်လိုရီ ပမာဏ တွက်မည် (+ အသားတက်ရန် ပိုစားရန်)
            </button>

            <!-- Result Box -->
            <div id="resultBox" class="mt-6 p-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/15 to-teal-500/15 dark:from-emerald-950/60 dark:to-teal-950/60 border border-emerald-300/60 dark:border-emerald-700/60 rounded-2xl hidden backdrop-blur-md space-y-3 shadow-inner">
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center pb-3 border-b border-emerald-200/50 dark:border-emerald-900/50 gap-1">
                    <span id="resMaintLabel">သင်၏ ပုံမှန်လောင်ကျွမ်းမှု (Maintenance Calories):</span>
                    <span id="maintenanceVal" class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">0 kcal</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 font-bold flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5" id="resTargetLabel">🎯 အသားတက်ဖို့ လိုအပ်သည့် ကယ်လိုရီ:</span>
                    <span id="targetVal" class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-800/80 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-emerald-200 dark:border-slate-700">0 kcal</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Daily Food & AI Calorie Tracker -->
        <section class="glass-card rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 transition duration-300 hover:shadow-teal-500/10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                <div class="p-3 bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 rounded-2xl shadow-inner shrink-0 border border-teal-500/30">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white" id="trackerTitle">၂။ AI အစားအစာ အကြံပြုချက် နှင့် ကယ်လိုရီ တိုင်းတာရန်</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" id="trackerSub">စားမည့် အစားအစာနာမည် ရိုက်ထည့်ပါ သို့မဟုတ် ကင်မရာဖြင့် ဓာတ်ပုံရိုက်၍ ကယ်လိုရီစကန်ဖတ်ပါ</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- AI Suggestion Generator Button & Box -->
            <div class="mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500/10 via-emerald-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 dark:from-teal-950/50 dark:to-cyan-950/50 p-4 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-teal-200/80 dark:border-teal-800/80 shadow-md flex flex-col gap-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
